            "review_title": "Review at Riviera Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Prima P\nNew York City, New York17 contributions\n0\nFriendly and attentive service\nMar 2025 • Solo\nI am staying at Le Sands Hotel and ate dinner at Riviera Restaurant on my first night. Food is delicious and the atmosphere is inviting. Service is very attentive. Annie gave me great recommendations for dinner and sightseeing as well. I enjoyed our chat about Vietnamese cuisine. Looking forward to breakfast here too.\nWritten March 17, 2025",
