            "reviewer_id": "User_p1_2",
            "review_title": "Review at Riviera Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Ivyy1712\nSingapore, Singapore57 contributions\n0\nTop notch!\nDec 2023 • Family\nWe check in to Le sands Oceanfront Danang Hotel on a “stormy” weather. Hence was unable to go out to eat outdoors. We decided to try the Riviera Restaurant situated on the 3rd floor of the Hotel for easy access. We ordered a spaghetti, Pho, Cheesy Pizza, Salted Caramel Coffee which is their signature. The foods & drinks definitely blow you away! Delicious and prices are all very reasonable & affordable. Anyone whom is nearby should try this restaurant even if you are not their hotel guests. Special shoutout to their service staff - Ms Rosy whom was 5 months pregnant, served us personally with heavy plates and advised us which place to go. This is the same place where they served their daily breakfast as well. Rosy is hardworking and often seen smiling and serving customers with 100% dedication. Please pass this praise to her when you see this review. She is the gem in your hotel & restaurant! Thank you Rosy! We hope to see you again the next time, your baby girl would be a few years old. Thank you everyone at Riviera Restaurant. Highly recommended!\nRead more\nWritten December 27, 2023",
